title: Unions Declare Independence
new-page: true 
subtitle: Labor's disagreements with our policies have grown too severe.
tags: event
view-if: labor_dissent >= 60 and traditionalist_leader == "Lambach" and not unions_independent and chancellor != "Staal"
on-arrival: {!
Q.unions_independent = 1;

if (Q.labor_strength < 10) {
    Q.commons_marcher -= 16;
    Q.disfavored_marcher -= 8;
    if (Q.sapd_formed) {
        Q.commons_sapd += 8;
        Q.disfavored_sapd += 4;
    } else {
        Q.commons_collectivist += 4;
    }
    Q.commons_collectivist += 4;
    Q.commons_royalist += 4;

    Q.commons_traditionalist += 8;
    Q.disfavored_traditionalist += 4;

    Q.banner_strength -= 400;
} else if (Q.labor_strength < 25) {
    Q.commons_marcher -= 20;
    Q.disfavored_marcher -= 10;
    if (Q.sapd_formed) {
        Q.commons_sapd += 10;
        Q.disfavored_sapd += 6;
    } else {
        Q.commons_collectivist += 5;
    }
    Q.commons_collectivist += 5;
    Q.commons_royalist += 5;

    Q.commons_traditionalist += 9;
    Q.disfavored_traditionalist += 5;

    Q.banner_strength -= 500;
} else if (Q.labor_strength < 40) {
    Q.commons_marcher -= 22;
    Q.disfavored_marcher -= 12;
    if (Q.sapd_formed) {
        Q.commons_sapd += 12;
        Q.disfavored_sapd += 8;
    } else {
        Q.commons_collectivist += 6;
    }
    Q.commons_collectivist += 6;
    Q.commons_royalist += 6;

    Q.commons_traditionalist += 10;
    Q.disfavored_traditionalist += 6;

    Q.banner_strength -= 600;
} else if (Q.labor_strength < 60) {
    Q.commons_marcher -= 24;
    Q.disfavored_marcher -= 14;
    if (Q.sapd_formed) {
        Q.commons_sapd += 15;
        Q.disfavored_sapd += 10;
    } else {
        Q.commons_collectivist += 7;
    }
    Q.commons_collectivist += 7;
    Q.commons_royalist += 7;

    Q.commons_traditionalist += 12;
    Q.disfavored_traditionalist += 7;

    Q.banner_strength -= 700;
} else {
    Q.commons_marcher -= 26;
    Q.disfavored_marcher -= 16;
    if (Q.sapd_formed) {
        Q.commons_sapd += 18;
        Q.disfavored_sapd += 12;
    } else {
        Q.commons_collectivist += 8;
    }
    Q.commons_collectivist += 8;
    Q.commons_royalist += 8;

    Q.commons_traditionalist += 14;
    Q.disfavored_traditionalist += 8;

    Q.banner_strength -= 800;
}

Q.commons_royalist -= 3;
Q.commons_collectivist -= 3;

Q.labor_strength /= 2;

Q.n_advisors_start = Q.n_advisors;
if (Q.woytinsky_advisor === 1) Q.n_advisors -= 1;
if (Q.leipart_advisor === 1) Q.n_advisors -= 1;
Q.woytinsky_advisor = 0;
Q.leipart_advisor = 0;
if (Q.n_advisors < Q.n_advisors_start) Q.shuffle_leadership_timer = 0;
!}
max-visits: 1

= Unions Declare Independence

Our policy choices have greatly offended the labor movement. Union leaders have declared that they are independent of any political party, and some have been seen seeking accommodation with the extremists on the <span style="color: #700000;">far</span>-<span style="color: #9B0000;">left</span> and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span>. However, a sizeable majority of unionists however are identifying with the <span style="color: #6D5298;">Christian Socials</span> of the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>, who now control their leadership.

Most workers remain loyal to the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>, although their affiliation is less solid. Many workers move left[? if sapd_formed:, to the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> or the nascent <span style="color: #9B0000;">**SAPD**</span>?]. Others move in a more nationalist direction, towards the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> as the ADGB signals its willingness to work with the <span style="color: #6D5298;">Christian Socials</span> to solve the economic crisis.

Much of our working-class base has defected, and labor's influence in our party has greatly diminished.
